          "title": "Bound the ping subprocess runtime",
          "impact": "ping_worker accepts any positive count and then runs ping synchronously. A caller that passes a very large count can keep the dscli helper occupied for minutes or hours and leave a long-running child process, which is avoidable operator-side resource consumption even though this is not a cache request path.",
